 "title": "5 V uni-directional high-capacitance ESD and surge protection diode pair, SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "Two uni-directional TVS diodes in a SOT-23 with their cathodes on pins 1 and 2 and a shared anode on pin 3, guarding two lines against the common pin. Each line stands off 5.0 V, breaks down between 6.0 V and 9.0 V at 1 mA, leaks no more than 0.2 µA at 5 V and clamps at 14 V max with a 25 A 8/20 µs surge. ESD withstand is ±30 kV air and contact to IEC 61000-4-2; capacitance is up to 180 pF at 0 V. Listed uses include handsets and accessories, PDAs, notebooks and handhelds, portable instruments, industrial controls, servers and desktop PCs.",
